{"schema_version":1,"batch_id":"screening-0098","screening_model":"gpt-5.6-luna","reasoning":"medium","prompt_version":"gauss-screening-v1","item_count":6,"subject":"math","topic_key":"statistics","total_weight":108,"expected_output":"screening-0098.output.jsonl","items":[{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2020","source_sha256":"c5f162aed29baa6b2ef90aabeab9cea5c3e7f22a1bb45f48d737aa92eac90d4b","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"هرگاه میانگین $2a, 2, a, 3, 3, 4$ برابر ۳ باشد، انحراف معیار آن‌ها کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2020/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۲۰","aspect_ratio":13.9545}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2020/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.0185}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2020/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.1111}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{6}}{2}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2020/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.6724}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{6}}{3}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2020/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.75}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"میانگین داده‌ها برابر ۳ است:\n$$ \\overline{x} = \\frac{2a+2+a+3+3+4}{6} = 3 \\Rightarrow 3a+12=18 \\Rightarrow a=2 $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow \\sigma^2 = \\frac{(4-3)^2+(2-3)^2+(2-3)^2+0+0+(4-3)^2}{6} = \\frac{4}{6} = \\frac{2}{3} \\Rightarrow \\sigma = \\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{3} $$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2020/solution_6.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۰۲۰","aspect_ratio":0.2269}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2020/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2020/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2020/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2020/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2020/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2020/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2020/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"7a6766c4af94c0281cf7a83834bc5082f079e3c3ea7451218973ec886432cf22","bytes":1736},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2020/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"d9846b5850d1e012b1b308af0ba9f7e9727db1809e5bf415b1841ad86431f85f","bytes":2620},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2020/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"087cf21c044f2a5a9905486885a59ab15d4985a8ba0bd8978348738b99a50c36","bytes":5880},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2020/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"4ae9e15d202e525dae528bb24f147addb8e4818eadaa647f3585b633d9ad8a6e","bytes":5358},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2020/solution_6.webp","sha256":"84a65d11d7df291c5636cf8d6074a82dc397e6f68ffdd93478309c73cdd7c863","bytes":23558},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2020/stem_1.webp","sha256":"dba9be9b014a33da028841d1984685bcf42a78d8f63fb06358353daa7902fcb4","bytes":5782}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2020,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":188,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2021","source_sha256":"add2bc1cfe67284820a4c7fe19df3ffce9caaff289be21aea03d96357c6ec978","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"به هر یک از اعداد $2, 3, 3, 5, 4, 7, 6$ سه برابر میانگین را اضافه کرده‌ایم. واریانس آن‌ها چه‌قدر بیشتر شده است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2021/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۲۱","aspect_ratio":15.7436}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{90}{7}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2021/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.0185}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{30}{7}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2021/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.1111}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{10}{7}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2021/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.6652}],[{"type":"text","text":"صفر"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2021/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.7425}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر میانگین را به دست آوریم، عدد ثابتی می‌شود و اگر داده‌ها را با یک عدد ثابت جمع کنیم، واریانس داده‌ها تغییر نمی‌کند."}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2021/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2021/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2021/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2021/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2021/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2021/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"edf8490e9e91db0a1f58b972def71bee5c0d6f6815671b4122c5803b23c8b371","bytes":2226},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2021/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"e71dc4774611f304033fd8290911b731dc7cab5dea1a78a5988a95d09c3391db","bytes":2532},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2021/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"116eb36dba695f8f793e1507441204899600c7b0a15bbb618759a0ca4364f4d2","bytes":7818},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2021/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"6f5fbbd4403bead835c18928bbeab7c5842534b9acf761eb5e83f90522a5daf0","bytes":8174},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2021/stem_1.webp","sha256":"029ded6de7f023cf45f3599e137fcef01152f5094c2d8be27880069f2a319efb","bytes":6676}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2021,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":188,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2022","source_sha256":"b69a3e691611ac3779d155df57e6817e11d77ab69a40651f972cd9a3ed8e1aad","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر هر یک از اعداد $2, 2, 3, 4$ سه برابر شوند، واریانس داده‌های جدید چند برابر واریانس داده‌های اولیه است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2022/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۲۲","aspect_ratio":15.7436}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{9}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2022/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.0185}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2022/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.1111}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{3}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2022/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.6652}],[{"type":"text","text":"$9$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2022/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.7425}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"هرگاه داده‌ها در عدد ثابت $a$ ضرب شوند، واریانس آن‌ها در $a^2$ ضرب می‌شود:\n$$ a = 3 \\Rightarrow a^2 = 9 $$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2022/solution_6.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۰۲۲","aspect_ratio":0.1004}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2022/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2022/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2022/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2022/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2022/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2022/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2022/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"2f062d5456ba9f0e7a38c2c8bacf7d52974b586bea427c67f0fbf1e0e2fe0e5c","bytes":1982},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2022/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"c9e7a6367cbd5c97c47a9224169f038315d7555335945555b3a814fbc94061af","bytes":2594},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2022/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"a3d13c098ccbf263ed9195a5217277658c33840088704a7ec2d14dc3af90116e","bytes":4410},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2022/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"b59515af44cde2acaa12a8bc80673287aeff1274b326f2d36ceed8f02bc1e430","bytes":4588},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2022/solution_6.webp","sha256":"c430a4f814aba9b648420bdf9f7c27893184dc3c4af5736f800e6aabc10562f3","bytes":9428},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2022/stem_1.webp","sha256":"0dd87578f3d51f498657ad199d23235f39ad0c83796fa2bdcfbb4e9c13a292db","bytes":2604}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2022,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":188,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2023","source_sha256":"10bf51eaee35d0db9cc169b65b2791f2900fb1cb7432ff2248b6069ebf4eeefd","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر واریانس اعداد مثبت $2x_1+3, 2x_2+3, ..., 2x_5+3$ برابر ۶ باشد، واریانس داده‌های $3x_1+2, 3x_2+2, ..., 3x_5+2$ چه عددی است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2023/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۲۳","aspect_ratio":13.9545}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$9$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2023/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.4773}],[{"type":"text","text":"$11$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2023/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.5909}],[{"type":"text","text":"$13/5$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2023/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":2.1436}],[{"type":"text","text":"$15/5$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2023/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":2.2431}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر داده‌های $3+2x_i$ را در $\\frac{3}{2}$ ضرب نموده و سپس $\\frac{5}{2}$ واحد کم کنیم به داده‌های $3x_i+2$ می‌رسیم. کاسته شدن $\\frac{5}{2}$ واحد از داده‌ها تأثیری بر واریانس ندارد، اما با ضرب $\\frac{3}{2}$ در داده‌ها واریانس $(\\frac{3}{2})^2$ برابر می‌شود:\n$$ \\sigma_{\\text{جدید}}^2 = (\\frac{3}{2})^2 \\times 6 = \\frac{27}{2} = 13/5 $$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2023/solution_6.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۰۲۳","aspect_ratio":0.1908}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2023/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2023/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2023/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2023/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2023/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2023/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2023/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"c25c08f2a75c38d8c7bab6bdda463de95d035a8c58d2a3521d06faac2f1ce238","bytes":1866},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2023/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"252a014cd13b4c34ea2256c619bb71ab5a8d792b667a30377ee3b8ca0ba10b86","bytes":2216},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2023/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"232b159044507899ec8271739c2bae702dd08c98a06769afeffbda2278216bce","bytes":4440},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2023/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"05ac2fe6466322d5afdff96397e4c6c4e56c981520df15a90e317609cd71f01f","bytes":4194},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2023/solution_6.webp","sha256":"1872a7e8107eb103cb89d9293175c46761677e97e578aa62754437357ea43896","bytes":20368},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2023/stem_1.webp","sha256":"e44ae651c225f260afc5a27dd309dd8325498a718dfa7c48e5ee94d87669adf8","bytes":3070}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2023,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":188,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2024","source_sha256":"d892c21d069393d623aa924db98bd5a744ac198c1bc1844efb62be021442ab23","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"میانگین و انحراف معیار اعداد $a, b, c, d$ به ترتیب ۳ و ۱ است. واریانس هشت دادهٔ $a, b, c, d, 3, 3, 3, 3$ چه عددی است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2024/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۲۴","aspect_ratio":13.9545}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$1$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2024/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.0185}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{2}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2024/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.1111}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{4}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2024/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.6652}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{8}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2024/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.7425}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"میانگین داده‌های اولیه ۳ است:\n$$ \\frac{a+b+c+d}{4} = 3 \\Rightarrow a+b+c+d=12 $$\nواریانس داده‌های اولیه ۱ است:\n$$ \\sigma^2 = \\frac{(a-3)^2+(b-3)^2+(c-3)^2+(d-3)^2}{4} = 1 $$\nحال، برای ۸ دادهٔ جدید داریم:\n$$ \\overline{x} = \\frac{\\overbrace{a+b+c+d}^{12}+12}{8} = 3 $$\n$$ \\text{واریانس} = \\frac{(a-3)^2+(b-3)^2+(c-3)^2+(d-3)^2+4 \\times 0}{8} = \\frac{4}{8} = \\frac{1}{2} $$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2024/solution_6.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۰۲۴","aspect_ratio":0.3534}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2024/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2024/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2024/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2024/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2024/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2024/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2024/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"6d791727b4cca734c1f6b7c2a6cd02c36dd4bfc61ac7f51d15acb8571cf5ee9a","bytes":1708},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2024/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"517eab0242b62a373c0c08f49cbddac6bec80d30d7aad2abfe5e304eab9b17e4","bytes":2348},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2024/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"54eef740a98f155429cde0e5413cf0883a851f03ac6e12dd1e995a98befd723e","bytes":3316},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2024/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"1bea4be5af31d3c37a7b669df4e5897102f6d7ff066154b4c441893056ce702a","bytes":1084},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2024/solution_6.webp","sha256":"7ff1693d4bdaa80f4e6295e3281f04fff6f82bb437e2b285f0b9305fc135356b","bytes":25424},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2024/stem_1.webp","sha256":"5f3987b7fe79129e31c445416bd4d92ca63ef06f2cf34f701db8632a1196abd3","bytes":5566}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2024,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":188,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2025","source_sha256":"accd14bd8e5ca72b207bc982600fe3e6c8e49528210935e5d797e2c412c08c9f","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"انحراف معیار و ضریب تغییرات $x_1, x_2, x_3$ به ترتیب ۱ و $0/2$ است. ضریب تغییرات $1+1.2x_1, 1+1.2x_2, 1+1.2x_3$ چه عددی است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2025/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۲۵","aspect_ratio":13.9545}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$0/4$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2025/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.0185}],[{"type":"text","text":"$1/4$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2025/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.1111}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{3}{11}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2025/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":2.1111}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{3}{11}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2025/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":2.2037}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"میانگین داده‌های اولیه را حساب می‌کنیم:\n$\\text{CV} = \\frac{\\sigma}{\\overline{x}} \\Rightarrow 0/2 = \\frac{1}{\\overline{x}} \\Rightarrow \\overline{x} = 5$\nهمه داده‌ها در $2$ ضرب و با $1$ جمع شده‌اند، بنابراین میانگین نیز در $2$ ضرب و با $1$ جمع می‌شود:\n$\\overline{x}_{\\text{جدید}} = (2 \\times 5) + 1 = 11$\nاما انحراف معیار فقط در $2$ ضرب می‌شود:\n$\\sigma_{\\text{جدید}} = 2 \\times 1 = 2 \\Rightarrow \\text{CV}_{\\text{جدید}} = \\frac{2}{11}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2025/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2025/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2025/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2025/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2025/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2025/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"4b5999fa7da78e88b482e88d20a009602b039c440606059445cab4cbc46c33d5","bytes":1990},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2025/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"c36f49e88219607ea82579dcd2f414295aaa8181964f4e829083ef70046a8c02","bytes":2220},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2025/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"78464150eaf766ca985905f52974250d012051d68c06f67e9d9e81ac8c7aabf9","bytes":2476},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2025/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"329b25dd9031a63e98ebf09db38ba7adbd917447bd9079f34d8581aaf08bd576","bytes":1006},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2025/stem_1.webp","sha256":"02aefd2eacfc6d000e2e3f15dde4dea2f49bcbd3b24f24754291f7953f843124","bytes":9182}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2025,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":188,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true}]}
